# SABOTAGE: the CLI's `--root <tree>` switch itself. `@cli_switches` is the ONE strict list
# `parse_cli/1` feeds to OptionParser; dropping `root: :string` from it makes OptionParser hand
# `--root <path>` back in `invalid`, so `cli_opts/1` reports NO `:root` and `run/1` reverts to the
# cwd-discovery default — the command can then gate only the tree it happens to run inside, which
# is the whole regression `--root` exists to remove.
#
# HONEST DISCLOSURE (re-anchored after the `--format` work): the defect is the same line-level
# change, but the run's FAILURE MODE is now louder than it was. The argument guard added with
# `--format` sees the stray `--root` and reports it as an unrecognized argument, so this sabotage
# exits 1 rather than exiting 0 over the wrong tree. The switch is still load-bearing and only the
# named test says so: every other `--root` assertion drives `adoption_violations(adoption_root: …)`
# directly and stays green when the switch is unrecognized.
#
# SECOND RE-ANCHOR (the shared format spec): the context lines moved again when
# `@cli_switches` was rewritten to source `--format` from `Samen.Verifier.format_switch()`
# (one switch name, one type, for every verifier CLI) instead of spelling `format: :string`
# inline. The REMOVED and ADDED lines and the MUST_FAIL target are unchanged in meaning; the
# hunk was regenerated with `diff -u`, not re-typed.
# APP: samen_core
# TEST_FILES: test/verify_fleet_wire_test.exs
# MUST_FAIL: the CLI still RECOGNIZES --root (a dropped switch would revert to discovery)
diff --git a/samen_core/lib/mix/tasks/samen.verify.fleet_wire.ex b/samen_core/lib/mix/tasks/samen.verify.fleet_wire.ex
--- a/samen_core/lib/mix/tasks/samen.verify.fleet_wire.ex
+++ b/samen_core/lib/mix/tasks/samen.verify.fleet_wire.ex
@@ -155,7 +155,7 @@
   # `cli_invalid/1` reports what it could not (an unrecognized switch, or a value-less one).
   # `--format` comes from the shared harness spec, so a new adopter cannot spell it
   # differently and silently drop it.
-  @cli_switches [host: :string, router: :string, root: :string] ++
+  @cli_switches [host: :string, router: :string] ++
                   [Samen.Verifier.format_switch()]
 
   @impl Mix.Task
